{"2964520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deckadent", "steam_appid": 2964520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This is an old prototype not currently in development but it will be returned to and completed one day!</u></strong><br><br><br><br>Deckadent challenges you to build a deck from the cards you collect in the world through quests or other discoveries<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 38 unique cards to choose from. Get creative! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many NPCs offer quests, some silly and some serious, but all rewarding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monsters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the cozy art style fool you; the world is full of monsters, each with unique attacks and behaviors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Locations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four different worlds, each presenting its own challenges.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This is an old prototype not currently in development but it will be returned to and completed one day!</u></strong><br><br><br><br>Deckadent challenges you to build a deck from the cards you collect in the world through quests or other discoveries<br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 38 unique cards to choose from. Get creative! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quests:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many NPCs offer quests, some silly and some serious, but all rewarding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monsters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let the cozy art style fool you; the world is full of monsters, each with unique attacks and behaviors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Locations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four different worlds, each presenting its own challenges.</p>", "short_description": "Deckadent is a top-down deck building RPG with several quests, bosses, enemies, and various locations to explore. You play as a hero, chosen by the God of the Cards to drive out the Deckay from the other fallen gods.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964520/header.jpg?t=1764896487", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964520/a27a245c5626a0063af315de7de8fd6c25d0c8ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764896487", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964520/a27a245c5626a0063af315de7de8fd6c25d0c8ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764896487", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7870 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Stubbs Studios"], "publishers": ["Stubbs Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 3337820, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbn